__d(function(g,r,i,a,m,e,d){"use strict";Object.defineProperty(e,'__esModule',{value:!0}),Object.defineProperty(e,"HOW_TO_PLAY",{enumerable:!0,get:function(){return o}});const o={en:{imp:"IMP Classic is a bluffing game for one phone, passed around the group.\n\n1. Add your players, pick word categories and roles, then press START.\n\n2. Pass the phone around: everyone taps their own card and holds it to secretly see their role. Innocents see the secret word \u2014 the Imposter only gets one small clue.\n\n3. Starting with the player shown on screen, everyone says ONE word connected to the secret word. Too obvious and the Imposter catches on... too vague and YOU start looking like the Imposter.\n\n4. Discuss who sounded like they were bluffing, then vote: on three, everyone points at their suspect.\n\n5. Caught Imposters get one last chance \u2014 guess the secret word out loud and steal the win! Extra roles like the Jester and the Helper mix things up: their cards explain how they win.",mafia:"Mafia is the classic party game of deception \u2014 the app deals the roles, your group plays it out loud.\n\n1. Add your players and pick which roles are in the game (there is always at least one Mafia), then press START.\n\n2. Pass the phone around: everyone taps their own card and holds it to secretly see their role and what it does.\n\n3. Play in rounds: the town \"sleeps\" (everyone closes their eyes), the night roles wake up one by one and act, then everyone wakes up, hears what happened, discusses and votes someone out. If a Narrator is in the game, they run the show.\n\n4. The town wins when all the Mafia are gone \u2014 the Mafia wins when they outnumber the town. When the game is over, press \"Reveal roles\" to show who was who.",blef:"Bluff is a duel for exactly 2 players on one phone.\n\n1. Turn on exactly two players, pick word categories, then press START.\n\n2. Each of you privately holds your card to see YOUR clue. Here's the catch: sometimes you're both holding the real word, sometimes only one of you is, and sometimes neither of you is \u2014 you're each just holding a hint. You are never told which.\n\n3. Taking turns, you each say clues out loud about what you're holding. Someone with only a hint has to bluff convincingly \u2014 and someone with the real word has to decide how much to give away.\n\n4. On three, both of you call it out loud: did the other one have the WORD, or just a HINT?\n\n5. Reveal: see the real word and what you each were actually holding.",faker:"Faker \u2014 everyone answers the same question... except one player, who secretly got a slightly different one.\n\n1. Add your players, pick question categories, then press START and choose how you're playing (one phone, or everyone on their own \u2014 coming soon).\n\n2. Pass the phone around: each player privately reads their question and types an answer. The Faker doesn't know they're the Faker \u2014 their question just isn't quite the same.\n\n3. All answers are revealed with names. Read them out loud and discuss: whose answer doesn't quite fit?\n\n4. Pass the phone again \u2014 everyone votes for who they think got the different question. You can't vote for yourself.\n\n5. Results: the votes, who got voted out, who the Faker really was, and both questions side by side.",odd:"Odd One Out \u2014 everyone gets a word... but one player's word is slightly different.\n\n1. Add your players, pick pair categories, then press START.\n\n2. Pass the phone around: everyone taps their own card and holds it to secretly see their word. Nobody knows who has the different one \u2014 maybe it's you!\n\n3. Starting with the player shown on screen, everyone says ONE clue about their own word. Listen closely: whose clues feel just a little... off?\n\n4. Discuss, then on three, everyone points at who they think the Odd One Out is \u2014 and reveal!\n\nTip: keep your clues a bit vague. Say too much and the Odd One Out figures out the group's word and blends right in."},sr:{imp:"IMP Classic je igra blefiranja za jedan telefon koji se dodaje ukrug.\n\n1. Dodaj igra\u010de, izaberi kategorije re\u010di i uloge, pa pritisni PO\u010cNI.\n\n2. Dodajite telefon ukrug: svako dodirne svoju kartu i dr\u017ei je da tajno vidi svoju ulogu. Nevini vide tajnu re\u010d \u2014 impostor dobija samo jedan mali trag.\n\n3. Po\u010dev\u0161i od igra\u010da prikazanog na ekranu, svako ka\u017ee JEDNU re\u010d povezanu sa tajnom re\u010dju. Previ\u0161e o\u010digledno \u2014 i impostor provali re\u010d... previ\u0161e nejasno \u2014 i TI izgleda\u0161 kao impostor.\n\n4. Raspravite ko je zvu\u010dao kao da blefira, pa glasajte: na tri, svi upiru prstom u svog osumnji\u010denog.\n\n5. Uhva\u0107eni impostor ima poslednju \u0161ansu \u2014 ako naglas pogodi tajnu re\u010d, krade pobedu! Dodatne uloge kao D\u017eoker i Pomo\u0107nik za\u010dinjavaju igru: na njihovim kartama pi\u0161e kako pobe\u0111uju.",mafia:"Mafija je klasi\u010dna dru\u0161tvena igra prevare \u2014 aplikacija deli uloge, a vi igrate naglas.\n\n1. Dodaj igra\u010de i izaberi koje su uloge u igri (uvek postoji bar jedan mafija\u0161), pa pritisni PO\u010cNI.\n\n2. Dodajite telefon ukrug: svako dodirne svoju kartu i dr\u017ei je da tajno vidi svoju ulogu i \u0161ta ona radi.\n\n3. Igrajte u rundama: grad \"spava\" (svi zatvore o\u010di), no\u0107ne uloge se bude jedna po jedna i deluju, zatim se svi bude, \u010duju \u0161ta se desilo, raspravljaju i izglasavaju nekoga. Ako je Narator u igri, on vodi ceo \u0161ou.\n\n4. Grad pobe\u0111uje kad mafije vi\u0161e nema \u2014 mafija pobe\u0111uje kad nadbroji grad. Kad se igra zavr\u0161i, pritisni \"Otkrij uloge\".",blef:"Blef je dvoboj za ta\u010dno 2 igra\u010da na jednom telefonu.\n\n1. Uklju\u010di ta\u010dno dva igra\u010da, izaberi kategorije re\u010di, pa pritisni PO\u010cNI.\n\n2. Svako od vas nasamo dr\u017ei svoju kartu da vidi SVOJ trag. Kvaka je u tome: nekad oboje dr\u017eite pravu re\u010d, nekad samo jedan od vas, a nekad nijedan \u2014 tada oboje imate samo trag. Nikad vam se ne ka\u017ee \u0161ta je slu\u010daj.\n\n3. Naizmeni\u010dno govorite tragove naglas o onome \u0161to dr\u017eite. Ko ima samo trag mora ubedljivo da blefira \u2014 a ko ima pravu re\u010d mora da odlu\u010di koliko sme da oda.\n\n4. Na tri, oboje naglas recite: da li je onaj drugi imao RE\u010c ili samo TRAG?\n\n5. Otkrivanje: vidite pravu re\u010d i \u0161ta je ko zapravo dr\u017eao.",faker:"Folirant \u2014 svi odgovaraju na isto pitanje... osim jednog igra\u010da, koji je tajno dobio malo druga\u010dije.\n\n1. Dodaj igra\u010de, izaberi kategorije pitanja, pritisni PO\u010cNI i izaberi kako igrate (jedan telefon, ili svako na svom \u2014 uskoro).\n\n2. Dodajite telefon ukrug: svako nasamo pro\u010dita svoje pitanje i upi\u0161e odgovor. Folirant ne zna da je folirant \u2014 njegovo pitanje samo nije ba\u0161 isto.\n\n3. Svi odgovori se otkrivaju sa imenima. Pro\u010ditajte ih naglas i raspravite: \u010diji odgovor se ne uklapa?\n\n4. Dodajte telefon ponovo \u2014 svako glasa za onoga ko je po njemu dobio druga\u010dije pitanje. Ne mo\u017ee\u0161 da glasa\u0161 za sebe.\n\n5. Rezultati: glasovi, ko je izglasan, ko je stvarno bio folirant i oba pitanja jedno pored drugog.",odd:"Uljez \u2014 svi dobijaju re\u010d... ali jedan igra\u010d ima malo druga\u010diju.\n\n1. Dodaj igra\u010de, izaberi kategorije parova, pa pritisni PO\u010cNI.\n\n2. Dodajite telefon ukrug: svako dodirne svoju kartu i dr\u017ei je da tajno vidi svoju re\u010d. Niko ne zna ko ima druga\u010diju \u2014 mo\u017eda ba\u0161 ti!\n\n3. Po\u010dev\u0161i od igra\u010da prikazanog na ekranu, svako ka\u017ee JEDAN trag o svojoj re\u010di. Slu\u0161ajte pa\u017eljivo: \u010diji tragovi zvu\u010de malo... \u010dudno?\n\n4. Raspravite, pa na tri svi upiru prstom u onoga za koga misle da je uljez \u2014 i otkrijte!\n\nSavet: neka tragovi budu malo nejasni. Ako ka\u017ee\u0161 previ\u0161e, uljez \u0107e provaliti re\u010d grupe i savr\u0161eno se uklopiti."}}},335,[]);
